arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:3:These principles are mandatory for watchdog-triggered repair agents.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:5:1. Repair root causes, not symptoms. A restart is only a validation step after the underlying routing, state, source, credentials, or process issue has been understood.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:7:3. Respect declared routing. Use the chain spec, profile, vendor, and explicit phase overrides as the source of truth; do not silently invent a different provider because a fallback happens to be available.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:8:4. Codex phases must run through the Codex plan/CLI path. Do not convert Codex phases to generic OpenAI/OpenRouter API calls unless the chain explicitly asks for that.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:9:5. DeepSeek phases must run through the direct DeepSeek API credentials. Do not route DeepSeek through OpenRouter unless the chain explicitly asks for OpenRouter and the required key is present.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:11:7. Repair agents are supervisors, not replacement profiles. Do not pin every workflow phase to the repair model unless the chain explicitly requests that model for those phases.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:13:9. Deep investigations and source repairs must use the `$subagent-launcher` skill. The supervisor should collect evidence, read the launcher skill instructions, then dispatch the proper implementer/reviewer through that skill instead of doing all repair work in its own context.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:14:10. When source changes are needed, brief Codex through `$subagent-launcher` with the core issue, evidence, constraints, and plausible hypotheses. Point Codex in the right direction without prescribing the implementation; let Codex determine the solution.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:15:11. Validate narrowly, then persist. Run focused checks for the changed layer, commit and push source changes to `editible-install`, refresh the editable install, and then relaunch.
arnold_pipelines/megaplan/cloud/wrappers/principles.md:16:12. Finish with evidence: root cause, fix, validation commands, pushed commit if any, relaunch result, current health, and remaining blockers.
