   717	def driver_lock_path(plan_dir: Path) -> Path:
   718	    """Path of the per-plan ``auto`` driver-lifetime lockfile.
   719	
   720	    Distinct from ``plan_lock_path`` (``.plan.lock``), which is a SHORT per-step
   721	    lock the driver acquires and releases around each individual phase. The
   722	    driver lock is held for the WHOLE ``auto`` process so two ``megaplan auto``
   723	    invocations on the same plan can't interleave at step boundaries and contend
   724	    over plan state (the dueling-drivers zero-progress plateau).
